From c6de84839579e7053ae183be95031b59ca007cf2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Narendhar Reddy <quic_nare@quicinc.com>
Date: Thu, 4 Jul 2024 14:37:02 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] nl80211: move nl80211 changes to a single patch

Move NL80211 changes to single patch for nl80211 sync 
with hostapd and iw. 

Signed-off-by: Narendhar Reddy <quic_nare@quicinc.com>
---
 include/uapi/linux/nl80211.h | 429 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 420 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

--- a/include/uapi/linux/nl80211.h
